---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service — MovieQuiz" description="Terms of Service for MovieQuiz" noindex>
  <Header />
  <main class="legal-page">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: September 2026</p>

      <h2>Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>By using MovieQuiz, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the service.</p>

      <h2>Service Description</h2>
      <p>MovieQuiz provides free movie personality quizzes with AI-generated results and images. The service allows you to take quizzes, receive personalized results, and share them with others.</p>

      <h2>Usage Limits</h2>
      <p>You may generate up to 3 AI results per day. This limit is enforced server-side to prevent abuse and manage costs. Attempting to circumvent this limit may result in temporary access restrictions.</p>

      <h2>Acceptable Use</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Do not attempt to abuse, overload, or disrupt the service</li>
        <li>Do not attempt to reverse-engineer or extract AI models</li>
        <li>Do not use automated tools to generate results at scale</li>
        <li>Do not share offensive or harmful content through the platform</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>AI-Generated Content</h2>
      <p>Results and images are generated by AI models and may contain unexpected or imperfect content. We do not guarantee the accuracy, appropriateness, or quality of any specific result. AI-generated content should be used for entertainment purposes only.</p>

      <h2>Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>You may download and share your generated results for personal, non-commercial use. Movie character names and references are property of their respective owners and are used for entertainment purposes only.</p>

      <h2>Service Availability</h2>
      <p>We strive to maintain service availability but do not guarantee uninterrupted access. The service may be modified, suspended, or discontinued at any time without notice.</p>

      <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>MovieQuiz is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. We are not liable for any damages arising from the use of the service.</p>

      <h2>Changes to Terms</h2>
      <p>We may update these terms at any time. Continued use of the service constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding: 80px 0 60px;
    min-height: calc(100vh - 60px);
  }
  .container {
    max-width: 720px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .updated {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
  p {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  ul {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
</style>
